    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Wooden Man Weather\"\nsubtitle: \"Marquette & the central U.P.\"\nformat: dashboard\n---\n\n\n\n## Row {height=36%}\n\n### Global Thermometer\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class='wmw-outpost-card'>\n  <div class='wmw-op-header'>\n    <span class='wmw-op-title'>Global Human Thermometer</span>\n    <span class='wmw-op-badge' style='border-color: #f59e0b40; color: #f59e0b;'>EARTH RANK: 53%</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class='wmw-op-body'>\n    <p class='wmw-human-headline'>Today in Marquette at <span class='wmw-hl-warm'>73°F</span>, you are warmer than <span class='wmw-hl-warm'>53% of humanity</span>.</p>\n    <p class='wmw-human-sub'>Out of 8.2 billion people on Earth today, approximately <strong>4.3 billion</strong> are in cooler air right now.</p>\n    \n    <div class='wmw-earth-bar-shell'>\n      <div class='wmw-earth-bar-track'>\n        <div class='wmw-earth-bar-pin' style='left: 53%; border-color: #f59e0b;'></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class='wmw-earth-bar-labels'>\n        <span>Colder (0%)</span>\n        <span>Global Median (72°F)</span>\n        <span>Warmer (100%)</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='wmw-op-footer'>\n    <div class='wmw-stat-pill'>Marquette: <strong>73°F</strong></div>\n    <div class='wmw-stat-pill'>Global Median: <strong>72°F</strong></div>\n    <div class='wmw-stat-pill'>Coldest: <strong>-62°F (Vostok)</strong></div>\n    <div class='wmw-stat-pill'>Warmest: <strong>114°F (Kuwait)</strong></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### Big Lake & Woodstove\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class='wmw-outpost-card'>\n  <div class='wmw-op-header'>\n    <span class='wmw-op-title'>Big Lake & Woodstove</span>\n    <span class='wmw-op-badge' style='border-color: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.45); color: #38bdf8;'>Lake Superior</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class='wmw-op-body'>\n    <div class='wmw-gauge-list'>\n      <div class='wmw-gauge-item'>\n        <span class='wmw-gauge-label'>Lake Superior Water</span>\n        <span class='wmw-gauge-val'><strong style='color: #38bdf8;'>62°F</strong> <span class='wmw-gauge-sub'>Harbor</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; <strong style='color: #7dd3fc;'>55°F</strong> <span class='wmw-gauge-sub'>Open Lake</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class='wmw-gauge-item'>\n        <span class='wmw-gauge-label'>Lake Breeze / Surf</span>\n        <span class='wmw-gauge-val'><strong style='color: #34d399;'>Offshore Breeze</strong> <span class='wmw-gauge-sub'>— Calm near shore · Beach warmth</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class='wmw-gauge-item'>\n        <span class='wmw-gauge-label'>Flannel & Stove Index</span>\n        <span class='wmw-gauge-val'><strong style='color: #34d399;'>Level 2: Light Flannel</strong> <span class='wmw-gauge-sub'>— Windows cracked · Morning chill</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class='wmw-gauge-item'>\n        <span class='wmw-gauge-label'>Daylight Arc</span>\n        <span class='wmw-gauge-val'><strong style='color: #ffffff;'>12h 45m</strong> <span class='wmw-gauge-sub' style='color: #fca5a5; font-weight: 600;'>&nbsp;(-3m 17s/day)</span></span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class='wmw-op-footer'>\n    <div class='wmw-stat-pill'>Last Updated: <strong>Mon, Sep 7 · 9:30 PM EDT</strong></div>\n    <div class='wmw-stat-pill'>Marquette: <strong>46.54°N</strong></div>\n    <div class='wmw-stat-pill'>Lake Elev: <strong>602 ft</strong></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n## Row {height=64%}\n\n### Temperature\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class='wmw-chart-card' id='wmw-chart-temperature' data-metric='temperature'>\n<div class='wmw-chart-header'>\n<h4 class='wmw-chart-title'>Temperature: Today vs. Recent Historical Norms</h4>\n</div>\n<div class='wmw-chart-main'>\n<!-- Pinned Y-Axis Pane (Always 100% visible, never scrolls away!) -->\n<div class='wmw-y-axis-pane'>\n<svg class='wmw-y-axis-svg'